      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STATUE OF TIME (8) had been racing well without winning, recording four minors on end before copping a check in the run and finishing sixth in a OPEN at Mt Gambier (29.88). Has the ability and looks a key chance. GINA GULLA (7) hit the ground running with a slick early sectional but had to settle for a minor placing when a one length third over 530m at this track, clocking 31.06. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from four attempts. Overdue and expected to feature again. DOLAN (1) is going well, finishing in the placings twice in a row. Not beaten far last time when a 1.5 lengths third (43.79) in a Grade 5/6 at this track. Expected to bounce back to best. MOSCOW CHICK (5) generally performs well here at this distance.",
